cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use OpenGPL, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "OpenGPL: Governance Policy Language"
abstract: >-
  A policy language for AI agents that produces compliance evidence. One
  .gpl file says what an agent may take in, what it may produce, which tools
  and networks it may use, and which compliance frameworks apply. The
  reference SDK checks prompts and responses against the policy at runtime,
  records every decision, and turns the policy and its decision log into
  OSCAL, marking each NIST SP 800-53 control as enforced, heuristic or
  declared.
authors:
